  "content": "\n\n<a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3266\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6pLLiYf.png\"></a>\n<h2><strong>IngotCraft 模組</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ingotcraft\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/full_399140_downloads.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載量\" /></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ingotcraft\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dynamic/json?color=2d2d2d&amp;colorA=17b85a&amp;style=flat-square&amp;label=&amp;suffix= downloads&amp;query=downloads&amp;url=https://api.modrinth.com/v2/project/Kma1RCF3&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=2d2d2d\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載量\" /></a></p>\n\n基礎金屬的簡易合成\n\n<strong>此模組新增：</strong>\n\n- 鋼（原礦、原礦塊、鋼錠、鋼塊、鋼粒、工具、盔甲）\n- 青銅（原礦、原礦塊、青銅錠、青銅塊、青銅粒、工具、盔甲）\n- 鉛（原礦、原礦塊、鉛錠、鉛塊、鉛粒）\n- 銀（原礦、原礦塊、銀錠、銀塊、銀粒）\n- 錫（原礦、原礦塊、錫錠、錫塊、錫粒）\n- 銅（銅粒）\n- 採掘鎚（石頭、鐵、黃金、鑽石、下界合金、終界合金、鋼、青銅、Zurite）\n\n<strong>相容於：</strong>\n\n- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-mod-for-forge\" target=\"_blank\">Enderite 模組</a>\n- <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/kuro-materials\" target=\"_blank\">Kuro Materials 模組</a>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Kma1RCF3/images/af86e6613875dabb39280d2fa62723f16bfc8384.png\"><br>\n\n<strong>此模組使用標籤系統，因此與其他模組相容</strong>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>詳細資訊</summary>\n\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Kma1RCF3/images/e209f0f65475a32b92323097600c155a882d867b.png\" width=\"500\">\n\n</details>",
